<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Ipioca</Major>
    <Description>An Assassin rotation that use poison as base.

Electro-pierce, lighting crash,slash and shuriken.

Uses poison as base for faster electro-pierce, if u have high ping you want take ou the lighting crash (F).</Description>
